From f8ebe0f0de2df41572ba23786682123ba00ec01e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hyprdesk-ru <ru@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:40:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] i18n: add Russian interface
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add a full Russian catalog (locales/ru.toml, 4833 entries) and a Ru
variant to hyprdesk-i18n. Language detection follows LC_ALL/LC_MESSAGES/
LANG, and 'ru' can be chosen from Settings, the setup wizard, the
installer (--lang ru) and hd.config({ language = "ru" }).

Dates use ru_RU, sizes use КиБ/МиБ/ГиБ, the screen reader reports ru_RU,
and a catalogue_russe_complet test keeps the catalog complete and
placeholder-compatible with the English one.
